    "detailed_description": "A survival horror beat-em-up about escaping a property swarming with huge, deadly bugs (mushi).<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Limited healing items and saves.<br></li><li> Evade danger by rolling, jumping, and performing backflips.<br></li><li> Stomp or elbow drop downed mushi to do double damage.<br></li><li> Enemies that move from room to room.<br></li><li> Unlockable options, difficulties, and alternate player colours.<br></li><li> A variety of enemy types/variants.<br></li><li> All door keys explain what they unlock.<br></li><li> Only 1 puzzle and it's optional.<br></li><li> Different control options: Arrow Keys, WASD, Xbox Controller, PlayStation Controller</li></ul>",
